<p>Abbas - 8</p> 
<p>Ya kashefal karbe an wajhil Hussain,<br> Ikshif karbi be haqqe akhikal Hussain.</p> 
<p>Shabeer Ke Chehray Se Gham Door Karne Walay.<br> Tum Door Kar Do Aa Kar Abbas Gham Hamarey.</p> 
<p>Tum Baab-e-Hawaij Ho Zainab Ka Sahara Ho.<br> Ho Fazal-o-Karam Hum Pe Tum Fazal Ke Baba Ho.<br> Hum Kis Se Madad Mangay Koi Nahi Hamara.<br> Bas Jee Rahe Hain Maula Hum Aap Ke Saharey.</p> 
<p>Milney Ke Liye Aaon Hasrat Hai Mere Dil Ki.<br> Na Rasta Aasaan Hai Na Zaad-e-Safar Koi.<br> Mushkil Yeh Meri Hal Ho Mushkil Kusha Ke Betay.<br> Aa Jaein Jald Hum Bhi Darbar Mein Tumhare.</p> 
<p>Jab Ghar Mein Azakhana Ro Ro Ke Sajatay Hain.<br> Yeh Kehte Hoye Momin Hathoon Ko Uthatay Hain.<br> Zahra Ki Dua Ho Tum Sun Lo Dua Hamari.<br> Aa Jao Mere Ghar Bhi Umm Ul-Baneen Ke Pyaray.</p> 
<p>Matam Ki Qasam Maula Seene Ka Sakoon Tum Ho.<br> Aye Qamar-e-Bani Hashim Ab Chain Miley Dil Ko.<br> Oss Bali Sakina Ki Ghurbat Ka Wasta Hai.<br> Kano Se Jis Ke Cheeney Zalim Ne Goshwaray.</p> 
<p>Andaz-e-Wafadari Dunya Ko Sikhatay Hain.<br> Woh Hath Rahein Baqi Parcham Jo Uthatay Hain.<br> Main Wasta Oss Pal Ka Deta Hoon Tum Ko Maula.<br> Kat Kar Girey They Bazu Jab Nehar Ke Kinaray.</p> 
<p>Jo Godiyaan Khali Hain Ab Jald Unhein Bhar Do.<br> Oss Maa Ke Waseelay Se Aoulad Atta Kar Do.<br> Jholay Se Lipat Kar Jo Kehti Thi Mere Asghar.<br> Tum Bin Rubab Kaisay Ab Zindagi Guzarey.</p> 
<p>Beemar Shifa Paein Ho Jaein Reha Qaidi.<br> Sajjad Ki Ghurbat Ki Hai Tum Ko Qasam Ghazi.<br> Aabad Rahe Sar Pe Saya Tere Alam Ka.<br> Farsh-e-Aza Pe Aa Kar Ro Ro Ke Dil Pukarey.</p> 
<p>ZEESHANO RAZA Kyun Na Faryad Karein Tum Se.<br> Jab Zarbain Lagin Terah Shabeer Ki Gardan Pe.<br> Har Zarb Pe Maula Ne Ro Kar Tumhein Pukara.<br> Manzar Woh Yaad Kar Ke Rotay Hain Gham Ke Marey.</p>